# Absolute directory outside public/ and outside .next/.
# Submissions, including CVs, are stored only when this is set.
# Example (Windows): C:\frshx-intake
# Example (macOS/Linux): /var/frshx-intake
# FRSHX_INTAKE_DIR=

# Optional. Published on the Privacy Policy and Terms only when set.
# Do not invent these. Leave them unset until FRSHX supplies the real details.
# FRSHX_LEGAL_NAME=
# FRSHX_LEGAL_ADDRESS=
# FRSHX_PRIVACY_EMAIL=
